  "scaling": {
    "natural": "The value is already a 0-100 measure where 100 is best (share of population covered, WHO service coverage index); it is used as is.",
    "world": "0 and 100 are set at the 5th and 95th percentile of every country's latest value worldwide (data/reference.json), worst to best, on a log scale for skewed rates. Scores are clamped to 0-100. Adding countries to the atlas does not move anyone's score."
  },
